sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuário (sk)
  participant API as API (bsm-account-api)
  participant DB as SSOT (banco ssot)
  participant P as Publisher (bsm-account-publisher)
  participant NATS as NATS (Stream DESIRED)
  participant CONS as Consumidores (ipm.organization, sum.service)

  U->>API: POST /v1/bsm/accounts {displayName, billingCurrency, billingContacts, deletionProtection}
  API->>API: valida token JWT, permissão bsm.account.create, e-mail verificado
  API->>API: valida moeda (BRL, USD, EUR) e contatos (1-10 e-mails)
  API->>API: valida cota de billing accounts por dono (máx 5)
  API->>DB: Transação SQL atômica: INSERT bsm.account (Ready), INSERT outbox, INSERT idempotency
  API-->>U: 201 Created (Resource completo: phase Ready, observedGeneration 1)
  P->>DB: lê outbox pendente por ordem de sequence
  P->>NATS: publica desired.bsm.account.<resourceId>
  P->>DB: UPDATE outbox SET published_at = now()
  NATS->>CONS: entrega desired.changed para projeções de faturamento em outras features
